+
+## JSON Patch
+
+`applyPatch(document, patch)` applies an RFC 6902 patch without changing the input document. It
+supports `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy`, and `test`, and throws when a patch is invalid
+or cannot be applied.
+
+```ts
+import { applyPatch } from "json-toolkit";
+
+applyPatch({ names: ["Ada"] }, [{ op: "add", path: "/names/-", value: "Lin" }]);
+// { names: ["Ada", "Lin"] }
+```
